      <title>2026-10-01 早报：风波再起！C罗自宣退出葡萄牙本期集训</title>
      <link>https://m.zhibo8.com//news/web/zuqiu/2026-10-01/6abd29e4c4b4fnative.htm</link>
      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260930/202609302325344467.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260930/202609302325344467_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260930/202609302325344467_720.jpg"> </div><p>【C罗未登场事件再起风波】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-01/6abd57a7ca18anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">C罗：我决定离开国家队集训营，会在合适时候说明离开的真正原因</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/202610010303509267.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/202610010303509267.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/202610010303509267.jpg"> </div><p>C罗社媒发文，宣布决定离开葡萄牙队集训！他表示，将在合适时机公布原因。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-01/6abd617911066native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">葡萄牙足协官方：C罗已离开本期集训，球队专注备战丹麦、挪威</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/202610010325012139.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/202610010325012139.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/202610010325012139.jpg"> </div><p>在C罗自宣离开本期国家队集训后，葡萄牙足协官方发布公告，确认了C罗的决定。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-01/6abd6efdca541native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">葡媒：C罗不会再回到国家队，他的葡萄牙队生涯已经结束了</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260925/6ab58ae0ec458_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260925/6ab58ae0ec458.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260925/6ab58ae0ec458.jpg"> </div><p>葡萄牙媒体O Jogo消息，C罗不会再回到葡萄牙队，他的国家队生涯已经结束了。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-01/6abd592082596native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">光速打脸主教练！热苏斯刚称C罗会训练，C罗直接走人+发声明</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260923/6ab3f0011b8d5_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260923/6ab3f0011b8d5.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260923/6ab3f0011b8d5.jpg"> </div><p>此前葡萄牙主帅热苏斯在发布会做出回应，并称C罗将参加训练。但C罗随即直接离开训练场，并安排了离开的飞机。短时间后，C罗本人发布了声明，称决定离开本期国家队。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-01/6abd8d6112e7dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马卡：热苏斯和葡足协主席追到机场挽留C罗，但后者仍登上了飞机</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.49" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/6abd8e0d490f7.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.49" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.49" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/6abd8e0d490f7.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/6abd8e0d490f7.jpg"> </div><p>马卡报消息，葡萄牙主帅热苏斯和足协主席普罗恩萨追到了机场去挽留C罗，但最终C罗仍然登上了离开的飞机。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-01/6abd62b11ebeanative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">C罗退出集训时间线：对挪威赛后未谢场 连续3天缺训 宣布退出集训</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260925/6ab58aec0c070_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260925/6ab58aec0c070.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260925/6ab58aec0c070.jpg"> </div><p>C罗社媒宣布退出葡萄牙队集训，自他赛后未谢场风波仅过去4天。来看看这次事件的时间线整理。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-01/6abd797c2de19native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记录报致C罗：国家队高于所有人，C罗离开后，葡萄牙会继续前进</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.42" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/6abd7a31be92e.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.42" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.42" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/6abd7a31be92e.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/6abd7a31be92e.jpg"> </div><p>在葡萄牙主帅热苏斯的发布会，情况发生了一连串进展。先是C罗离开集训地，随后本人发声，后续甚至葡媒O Jogo称C罗不会再为国家队效力。如今记录报撰文，直接快进到C罗是时候告别了。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-01/6abd59b2bd289native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">葡媒：葡足协主席正全力劝说C罗回心转意 队友对他离开感到惊讶</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260925/6ab58aec0c070_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260925/6ab58aec0c070.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260925/6ab58aec0c070.jpg"> </div><p>《球报》报道，葡萄牙队友对C罗离开训练场感到惊讶，葡足协主席正全力劝说C罗回归。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-30/6abd27252038fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">若热·热苏斯：C罗没有罢训，我和他事前约好不踢挪威+丹麦的比赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.77" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260930/202609302319088389.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.77" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.77" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260930/202609302319088389_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260930/202609302319088389_720.jpg"> </div><p>葡萄牙国家队主教练若热·热苏斯出席欧国联赛前发布会，澄清了近期围绕C罗未登场后产生的争议。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-01/6abd341ba2ffbnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">热苏斯：我做得不妥的是该让C罗晚点热身 如果需要对丹麦他会出场</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.43" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/202610010011011729.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.43" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.43" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/202610010011011729_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/202610010011011729_720.jpg"> </div><p>热苏斯表示，他认为他做得不妥的地方在于，本该让C罗晚点热身。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-30/6abd2cf6f3b61native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">热苏斯：C罗告诉我想让他上场他就上，想让他坐板凳他就坐</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-30/6abd2cf6f3b61native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">热苏斯：之前和C罗说过他不上 但赛中怕可能需要他，就让他去热身</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.76" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260930/202609302342027060.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.76" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.76" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260930/202609302342027060.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260930/202609302342027060.jpg"> </div><p>热苏斯表示，外界热炒的所谓冲突并不存在，他与C罗早就有过明确的沟通。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-01/6abd39d5e6bd9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">葡媒：热苏斯发布会后C罗乘车离开训练场 主帅刚称他将会回归训练</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.25" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260918/6aacfa2cc19d8_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG