://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_230206/202302062135418762.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_230206/202302062135418762.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_230206/202302062135418762.jpg"> </div><p>曼城功勋主帅瓜迪奥拉今天打破沉默，公开表态支持曼城“克服难关”。利物浦跟队记者David Lynch对此抛出疑问。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-01/6abd657669ca3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">曼城赞助商阿提哈德：英超未进行任何沟通 将评估可行法律方案</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_200901/492578598011273499.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_200901/492578598011273499.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_200901/492578598011273499.jpg"> </div><p>曼城主赞助商阿提哈德航空发布声明，正考虑针对英超联赛采取法律行动。此前英超一份重磅裁决中，认定曼城违反财务规则，阿提哈德航空被牵涉其中。</p><a href="http://m.zhibo8.cc/topic/index.html?id=165" class="hide" style="     background: url('http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_200905/zt_422159